G54: polled Novatek NT36672C touch over SPI3 (boot-arg g54nvt=1).

The g54-xnu probe downloads the flashless firmware before XNU starts
(g54-xnu docs/experiments E24). This driver maps SPI3 (0x11013000), checks
the trim ID and reset state, then polls the event buffer 0x22d00 every
g54nvtms (default 8) ms, checks the report checksum and feeds up to ten
fingers (big-endian 4x coordinates, stock nvt_ts_work_func layout) to
sweet_hid_touch(), scaled from the firmware's abs_x/y_max to 1080x2400.
Off by default; no IRQ, firmware download or watchdog recovery yet.

